  "security_implications": "The chunk manages ndmreset_pending_q and lc_rst_pending_q. lc_rst_pending_q tracks a lifecycle reset asserted during an active ndm reset. A missed or prematurely cleared lifecycle reset indicator could cause the system to skip a security-critical lifecycle transition (e.g., lc escalation/degradation), potentially leaving secure state inconsistent. The interaction between ndmreset_req and ndmreset_ack, as well as the unconditional clearing of lc_rst_pending_q by ndmreset_ack, creates a window where a lifecycle reset event may be lost or ignored.",
